[h1]Fixture Mod[/h1]

A mod for [b]Europa Universalis IV[/b] that adds [i]missions[/i], [strike]bugs[/strike] and [url=https://example.com/path?a=1&b=2]links[/url][noparse]. Text with [brackets] stays text.[/noparse]

[img]https://example.com/banner.png[/img]

[h2]Features[/h2]

[list]
[*]Missions for:
[olist]
[*]Sweden
[*]Denmark
[/olist]
[*]Events with inline code
[/list]

